xt</div><ol class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-[14px]" style="color:#000000"><li>1 · We reply within 4 hours.</li><li>2 · You pick a slot that fits.</li><li>3 · We meet — and you leave with a plan.</li></ol></div></div><div class="col-span-12 lg:col-span-8"><form class="rounded-3xl border bg-white p-6 sm:p-10 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:gap-5" style="border-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.12);box-shadow:0 30px 80px -40px rgba(0,0,0,0.3)"><label class="block"><span class="block text-[11px] tracking-[0.22em] uppercase mb-2" style="color:#6b6b6b">Name<span style="color:#4ECDC4"> *</span></span><input required="" maxLength="100" class="w-full rounded-2xl border bg-white px-5 py-4 text-[15px] outline-none focus:border-black/70 transition" style="border-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.18);color:#000000" placeholder="Your full name" name="name"/></label><label class="block"><span class="block text-[11px] tracking-[0.22em] uppercase mb-2" style="color:#6b6b6b">Company<span style="color:#4ECDC4"> *</span></span><input required="" maxLength="120" class="w-full rounded-2xl border bg-white px-5 py-4 text-[15px] outline-none focus:border-black/70 transition" style="border-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.18);color:#000000" placeholder="Company name" name="company"/></label><label class="block"><span class="block text-[11px] tracking-[0.22em] uppercase mb-2" style="color:#6b6b6b">Work email<span style="color:#4ECDC4"> *</span></span><input type="email" required="" maxLength="160" class="w-full rounded-2xl border bg-white px-5 py-4 text-[15px] outline-none focus:border-black/70 transition" style="border-color:rgba(0,0,0,0.18);color:#000000" placeholder="you@company.com" name="email"/></label><label class="block"><span class="block text-[11px] tracking-[0.22em] uppercase mb-2" style="color:#6b6b6b">Industry<span style="color:#4ECDC4"> *</span></span><select name="industry" required="" class="w-full rounded-2xl border bg-white px-5 py-4 text-[15px] outline-none focus:border-black/70 transition" style="border-color:rg